      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosuwa asezerera Abarubeni n'Abagadi, n'ab'igice cy'umuryango wa Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma Yosuwa ahamagaza Abarubeni n'Abagadi, n'ab'igice cy'umuryango wa Manase ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.20+NUM.32.21+NUM.32.22+NUM.32.23+NUM.32.24+NUM.32.25+NUM.32.26+NUM.32.27+NUM.32.28+NUM.32.29+NUM.32.30+NUM.32.31+NUM.32.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 32.20-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.12+JOS.1.13+JOS.1.14+JOS.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 1.12-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " arababwira ati “Mwashohoje ibyo Mose umugaragu w'Uwiteka yabategetse byose, no mu byanjye nabategetse byose na byo mwaranyumviye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi icyo gihe cyose kugeza ubu ntabwo mwahemukiye bene wanyu, n'amategeko y'Uwiteka Imana yanyu na yo mwarayitondeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka Imana yanyu yaruhuye bene wanyu nk'uko yabasezeranyije, noneho mwebwe nimujye mu mahema yanyu muzasubire mu gihugu mwahawe, icyo Mose umugaragu w'Uwiteka yabahaye hakurya ya Yorodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icyakora mujye mugira umwete wo kwitondera amategeko, n'ibyo Mose umugaragu w'Uwiteka yabategetse ati ‘Nimukunde Uwiteka Imana yanyu, mugende mu nzira ibayoboye zose, mwitondere amategeko mwomatane na we, mukoreshereze Uwiteka Imana yanyu imitima yanyu yose n'ubugingo bwanyu bwose.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Yosuwa abaha umugisha, arabasezerera basubira mu mahema yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko igice kimwe cy'umuryango wa Manase, Mose yabahaye gakondo yabo i Bashani, ariko ikindi gice Yosuwa ni we wabahaye gakondo muri bene wabo hakuno ya Yorodani, iburengerazuba. Ariko Yosuwa akibasezerera ngo basubire mu mahema yabo, abaha umugisha na bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze arababwira ati “Nimusubire iwanyu mu mahema yanyu mujyanye ubutunzi bwinshi, murongōye amatungo menshi cyane, mujyanye ifeza n'izahabu n'imiringa, n'ibyuma n'imyenda myinshi cyane, nuko nimugabane na bene wanyu iminyago y'ababisha banyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Biyubakira igicaniro kuri Yorodani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Abarubeni n'Abagadi n'ab'igice cy'umuryango wa Manase, basubirayo bava mu Bisirayeli i Shilo yo mu gihugu cy'i Kanāni, bajya mu gihugu cy'i Galeyadi icyo bahindūye, aho bahawe gakondo nk'uko Uwiteka yategekesheje ururimi rwa Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagera mu gihugu gihereranye na Yorodani mu gihugu cy'i Kanāni, bahiyubakira igicaniro cy'amabuye kuri Yorodani cy'ikimenywabose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye Abisirayeli bumva ko Abarubeni n'Abagadi n'ab'igice cy'umuryango wa Manase bubatse igicaniro mu irasukiro ry'i Kanāni, mu gihugu gihereranye na Yorodani mu bw'Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero Abisirayeli babimenye, iteraniro ryabo ryose riteranira i Shilo kugira ngo bajye kubarwanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli baherako batuma Finehasi mwene Eleyazari umutambyi, ku Barubeni n'Abagadi n'ab'igice cy'umuryango wa Manase mu gihugu cy'i Galeyadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bamutumana n'abatware cumi. Umuryango wose w'Abisirayeli utoranywamo umutware umwe w'inzu ya sekuruza, umuntu wese muri bo yatoranyijwe mu bihumbi by'Abisirayeli ari umukuru w'inzu ya sekuruza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko bageze ku Barubeni n'Abagadi n'ab'igice cy'umuryango wa Manase mu gihugu cy'i Galeyadi, barababwira bati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.12.13+DEU.12.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guteg 12.13-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Iteraniro ryose ry'Uwiteka ryadutumye ngo ‘Iki gicumuro mwacumuye ku Mana y'Abisirayeli mwagicumuriye iki, ko muretse kuyoborwa n'Uwiteka mukiyubakira igicaniro, mukamugomera? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1+NUM.25.2+NUM.25.3+NUM.25.4+NUM.25.5+NUM.25.6+NUM.25.7+NUM.25.8+NUM.25.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 25.1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbese igicumuro cya Pewori kiratworoheye, icyo tutarakiranuka na cyo na bugingo n'ubu? Nubwo mugiga yateye mu iteraniro ry'Uwiteka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "byatuma muteshuka mukareka kuyoborwa n'Uwiteka? Kandi uyu munsi nimugomera Uwiteka, ejo azarakarira iteraniro ryose ry'Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niba igihugu cyanyu ari igihugu cyanduye, nimwambuke muze mu gihugu cy'ubuturo bw'Uwiteka, aho ihema ry'Uwiteka riri muturane natwe, ariko mwe kugomera Uwiteka, natwe mwe kutugomera, ngo mwiyubakire igicaniro kidatunganiye Uwiteka Imana yacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.7.1+JOS.7.2+JOS.7.3+JOS.7.4+JOS.7.5+JOS.7.6+JOS.7.7+JOS.7.8+JOS.7.9+JOS.7.10+JOS.7.11+JOS.7.12+JOS.7.13+JOS.7.14+JOS.7.15+JOS.7.16+JOS.7.17+JOS.7.18+JOS.7.19+JOS.7.20+JOS.7.21+JOS.7.22+JOS.7.23+JOS.7.24+JOS.7.25+JOS.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 7.1-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbese wa mugabo Akani mwene Zera ntiyacumuye akenda ku byashinganywe, umujinya w'Uwiteka ugaherako ukamanukira mu iteraniro ry'Abisirayeli? Kandi ubwo uwo mugabo yacumuraga, si we warimbutse wenyine.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwiregura kw'Abarubeni n'Abagadi, n'ab'igice cy'umuryango wa Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
